{"name":"Lapalgard","status":"ok","title":"Lapalgard","pageId":105097,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Lapalgard\" title=\"Category:Maps of Lapalgard\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Lapalgard</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lapaliiya\" title=\"Lapaliiya\">Lapaliiya</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Southwest_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Southwest Faerûn\">southwest Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Large town</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tempus\" title=\"Tempus\">Tempus</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler's type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Knight-Commander of the Fortress</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3,701 in <a href=\"/wiki/1373_DR\" title=\"1373 DR\">1373 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Lapalgard</b> was a large town in <a href=\"/wiki/Lapaliiya\" title=\"Lapaliiya\">Lapaliiya</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Southwest_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Southwest Faerûn\">southwest Faerûn</a> in the mid–14<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>. It was based around the ancient stronghold known as the <b>Fortress of Lapalgard</b>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Government_&amp;_Religion\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government &amp; Religion</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Population\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Population</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Activities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Activities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lapalgard?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It stood in the south of the realm, at the end of roads from <a href=\"/wiki/Ithmong_(Lapaliiya)\" title=\"Ithmong (Lapaliiya)\">Ithmong</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lushpool\" title=\"Lushpool\">Lushpool</a> via <a href=\"/wiki/Dungar\" title=\"Dungar\">Dungar</a>, and faced the <a href=\"/wiki/Dun_Hills_(Lapaliiya)\" title=\"Dun Hills (Lapaliiya)\">Dun Hills</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Bandit_Wastes\" title=\"Bandit Wastes\">Bandit Wastes</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tFRA-p9_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tFRA-p9-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lapalgard?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Facing attacks from <a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-ti\" title=\"Yuan-ti\">yuan-ti</a>, in the aptly named <a href=\"/wiki/-690_DR\" title=\"-690 DR\">Year of Fragile Beginnings, −690 DR</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Lapal\" title=\"Lapal\">Lapal</a> tribes united in the nation of Lapaliiya. Over the next ten years, they constructed the Fortress of Lapalgard and declared it a symbol of their unity and common cause.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p102_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p102-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p41_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p41-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The Fortress of Lapalgard stood strong for centuries, but no wars came to it after the fall of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shoon_Imperium\" title=\"Shoon Imperium\">Shoon Imperium</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/450_DR\" title=\"450 DR\">Year of the Corrie Fist, 450 DR</a>. Instead, a town grew around it, enriched by caravans passing between Lapaliiya and <a href=\"/wiki/Halruaa\" title=\"Halruaa\">Halruaa</a> through the <a href=\"/wiki/Talath_Pass\" title=\"Talath Pass\">Talath Pass</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Government_.26_Religion\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government_&amp;_Religion\">Government &amp; Religion</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Government &amp; Religion\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lapalgard?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Government &amp; Religion\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lapalgard was led by the Knight-Commander of the Fortress.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The civic deity of Lapalgard was <a href=\"/wiki/Tempus\" title=\"Tempus\">Tempus</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-8\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Population\">Population</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Population\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lapalgard?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Population\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The town had a population of 3,701 in 1373 DR.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-9\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Activities\">Activities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Activities\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lapalgard?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Activities\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The soldiers of Lapalgard conducted patrols of the Bandit Wastes and the northeastern <a href=\"/wiki/Mhair_Jungles\" title=\"Mhair Jungles\">Mhair Jungles</a> in equal measure.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p100_1-10\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lapalgard?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lapalgard?veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SK-p100-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-0\">1.00</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-1\">1.01</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-2\">1.02</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-3\">1.03</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-4\">1.04</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-5\">1.05</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-6\">1.06</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-7\">1.07</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-8\">1.08</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-9\">1.09</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p100_1-10\">1.10</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_L._Boyd\" title=\"Eric L. Boyd\">Eric L. Boyd</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Darrin_Drader\" title=\"Darrin Drader\">Darrin Drader</a> (July 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Serpent_Kingdoms\" title=\"Serpent Kingdoms\">Serpent Kingdoms</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p.